&lt;p&gt;Forge &amp;amp; Build is hiring a &lt;strong&gt;Store Manager&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;at our rental facility in &lt;strong&gt;Harcourt, IA&lt;/strong&gt;, and we’re looking for someone who’s ready to grow with us, bring energy and drive to their work, and help us build the future of construction.&lt;/p&gt;
