&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;Physical Therapy Assistant (PTA) – Home Health&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;Field-Based | Patient-Centered Care&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;Join VitalCaring – Where Your Work Changes Lives&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;At VitalCaring, care isn’t just what we do - it’s who we are.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;As a &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;Physical Therapy Assistant (PTA)&lt;/span&gt;, you play a key role in helping patients regain strength, mobility, and independence in the place they feel most comfortable - home. You’ll work one-on-one with patients, delivering personalized care that directly impacts their recovery and quality of life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;This is a role for someone who thrives in a hands-on, patient-focused environment and takes pride in making measurable progress with every visit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;Why Join VitalCaring?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;  margin-top: 0in; margin-bottom: 0in;&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; vertical-align: middle;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold; font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;Make a Real Impact&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt; – Help patients restore function and regain independence&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; vertical-align: middle;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold; font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;One-on-One Care&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt; – Build meaningful relationships in a home setting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; vertical-align: middle;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold; font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;Autonomy with Support&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt; – Manage your day with guidance from an experienced PT team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; vertical-align: middle;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold; font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;Collaborative Environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt; – Partner with therapists, nurses, and care teams&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; vertical-align: middle;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold; font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;Growth &amp;amp; Development&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt; – Ongoing training and career advancement opportunities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; vertical-align: middle;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold; font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;Work-Life Balance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt; – Flexibility designed for field-based care&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; vertical-align: middle;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold; font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;Comprehensive Benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt; – Medical, Dental, Vision, 401(k) match, PTO, and more&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;Deliver High-Quality Patient Care&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;  margin-top: 0in; margin-bottom: 0in;&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; vertical-align: middle;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;Provide direct physical therapy services under the direction of a licensed Physical Therapist &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; vertical-align: middle;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;Follow individualized plans of care to help patients reduce pain, improve mobility, and restore function &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; vertical-align: middle;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;Assist patients with therapeutic exercises, gait training, balance, and functional mobility &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; vertical-align: middle;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;Support patients with transfers, strengthening, and activities of daily living &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; vertical-align: middle;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;Utilize therapeutic modalities such as heat, cold, ultrasound, and electrical stimulation as appropriate &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; vertical-align: middle;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;Educate patients and caregivers on exercises, safety, and use of assistive devices &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;Monitor Progress &amp;amp; Communicate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;  margin-top: 0in; margin-bottom: 0in;&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; vertical-align: middle;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;Observe and report patient progress, response to treatment, and any changes in condition &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; vertical-align: middle;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;Maintain accurate, timely documentation in the EMR &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; vertical-align: middle;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;Communicate effectively with the Physical Therapist and interdisciplinary care team &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; vertical-align: middle;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;Participate in case conferences and care coordination efforts &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;Collaborate &amp;amp; Contribute&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;  margin-top: 0in; margin-bottom: 0in;&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; vertical-align: middle;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;Work closely with nurses, therapists, and other healthcare professionals to ensure coordinated care &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; vertical-align: middle;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;Participate in team meetings, in-services, and ongoing training &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; vertical-align: middle;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;Uphold clinical standards and contribute to quality improvement efforts &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;What Sets You Apart&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;  margin-top: 0in; margin-bottom: 0in;&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; vertical-align: middle;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;Strong patient-first mindset with a passion for rehabilitation &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; vertical-align: middle;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;Ability to motivate and engage patients throughout recovery &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; vertical-align: middle;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;Excellent communication and time management skills &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; vertical-align: middle;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;A compassionate, proactive approach aligned with our values: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold; font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;Trustworthy. Capable. Compassionate. Proactive. Called. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;What You Bring&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;  margin-top: 0in; margin-bottom: 0in;&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; vertical-align: middle;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;Graduate of an accredited Physical Therapy Assistant (PTA) program &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; vertical-align: middle;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;Current PTA license or certification as required by state law &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; vertical-align: middle;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;1+ year of experience preferred (home health experience a plus) &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; vertical-align: middle;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;Current CPR certification &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; vertical-align: middle;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;Valid driver’s license, reliable transportation, and auto insurance &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;Who We Are&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;Founded in 2021, VitalCaring is a leading home health and hospice provider with 100+ locations nationwide. Our mission is simple: &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;to transform lives and foster hope through genuine caring.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellness&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;Medical, Dental &amp;amp; Vision&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;Pharmacy Benefits&lt;/p&gt;
